! Release 0.20.0

!! Smart Token Preview, Project Refiling, Container Queries & Accessibility

* ''Live Smart-Token Preview Bar (`QuickInputWidget`)'':
** Added live inline token feedback pills (`.py-smart-token-preview` / `.py-token-pill`) below task capture inputs showing recognized `#Project`, `!P1`–`!P3`, `📅 Due`, `☀️ Start`, and `@context` tokens as you type
* ''One-Click Project Refiling (`TodoProject`)'':
** Added a Move-to-Project picker in both the inline hover action bar / mobile overflow menu (`TodoActions`) and the task tiddler header (`TodoHeading`) to refile tasks between Inbox and any active Project in two clicks
* ''Configurable Task Row Density'':
** Added a Comfortable (`8px`) vs. Compact (`4px`) task list density setting in Control Panel > Projectify (`$:/config/projectify/Density`) powered by `--suite-row-padding-y` and `.suite-density-compact`
* ''Streamlined Progressive Disclosure Menus & Time/Repeat Drawer'':
** Refined task `...` actions and Date Picker popups with compact icon + label grids, mutually exclusive progressive disclosure drawers, and a unified `Time / Repeat` drawer
* ''Container Queries (`@container`) & Responsive Layout'':
** Added `container-type: inline-size` on `.py-todos` and `.py-board-container` with `@container (max-width: 680px)` rules so narrow side-by-side tiddler columns automatically collapse into the compact mobile menu layout, and updated fixed popup positioning to account for CSS containment offsets
* ''Accessibility, Keyboard Navigation & Performance'':
** Added WAI-ARIA `role="combobox"`, `aria-expanded`, `aria-controls`, `aria-activedescendant`, `enterkeyhint="done"`, and IME composition guards (`event.isComposing`) on task inputs; `aria-label` and `aria-pressed` on task completion and status/priority/context toggles; and `role="tablist"` / `role="tab"` / `aria-selected` on mobile Kanban column switchers
** Preserved DOM sequential focus order on Kanban cards by removing CSS `order` swaps and `display: contents`
** Replaced `O(N^2)` `contains:blocked-by` filter scans with TiddlyWiki's reverse-indexed `listed[blocked-by]` operator (`O(N)`)
** Moved automatic locale clock detection to `$:/temp/projectify/LocaleTimeFormat` so booting the wiki never dirties TiddlyWiki's saver

! Release 0.19.0

!! Unified Suite Design System & Dark-Mode Polish

* ''Zero-Dependency Suite Token Architecture (`--suite-*`)'':
** Added standalone-safe `--suite-*` custom property mappings across all cards, omnibar inputs, buttons, badges, and empty-state dropzones so Projectify automatically inherits Slipstream's theme tokens while falling back cleanly to TiddlyWiki 5.4 `--tpc-*` palette variables when installed standalone
* ''Dark-Mode Project Category Cards & Control Standardization'':
** Updated colored Project cards to blend category colors (`--py-card-bg`) at `14%` into `--suite-surface-card` via `color-mix()`, preserving crisp text legibility in both light and dark palettes
** Standardized `.py-btn` and `.py-composite-input.py-omnibar` radii (`--suite-radius-sm` / `--suite-radius-md`), heights (`36px` desktop / `44px` mobile), and `:focus-visible` rings across the suite

! Release 0.18.0

!! UI/UX Overhaul, Mobile Kanban Carousel & Progressive Disclosure

* ''Single-Line Task Capture Omnibar & Inline Quick-Add'':
** Redesigned `AddTodo` into a single-row `.py-omnibar` integrating the task input, schedule pill, priority flag, and submit button
** Added inline `+ Add todo` triggers at the bottom of Project sections (List View) and Kanban status columns (`To Do`, `In Progress`, `Waiting`) that automatically assign the target section or status
* ''Mobile Kanban Horizontal Swipe Carousel & Whole-Card Dragging'':
** Replaced vertical column stacking on mobile with a horizontal `scroll-snap-type: x mandatory` swimlane carousel and a synchronized top status-pill switcher (`To Do`, `In Progress`, `Waiting`, `Done`)
** Made entire Kanban cards draggable with intra-column card-to-card reordering (`board-card-drop-actions`) and priority left-border accents
* ''Progressive Disclosure & Compact Task Option Menus'':
** Unified due date, start/scheduled date, and recurrence into a single schedule pill on task rows and cards
** Redesigned the task `...` actions menu and Date Picker popup with a unified Status + Priority top bar and mutually exclusive collapsible drawers for `Calendar`, `Time / Repeat`, and `Context & Blocked by`
** Added viewport-clamped `position: fixed` popup positioning so Kanban and mobile task menus never clip or overflow the screen
* ''Theme Contrast & Visual Polish'':
** Replaced hardcoded grays and alert-red count badges with TiddlyWiki 5.4 `--tpc-*` palette variables and neutral `.py-count` badges (reserving `.py-count-alert` for overdue/today alerts)
** Added hover quick-rename button on desktop task rows and enlarged mobile touch targets

! Release 0.17.0

!! Web Push Notifications & Time-Based Scheduling

* ''TiddlyPWA Web Push Notification Integration'':
** Added automatic Tier 2 declarative notification rules for Due (`$:/config/projectify/notifications/TodoDueRule`) and Scheduled (`$:/config/projectify/notifications/TodoScheduledRule`) tasks with actionable push buttons (''Mark Done'' and ''Open Task'')
** Added quick one-tap task reminders (+15m, +1h, +3h, Tomorrow 9 AM) via `$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/ui/forms/TodoReminder`
** Added Notifications settings tab (`$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/ui/config/Notifications`) in Control Panel > Projectify
* ''Specific-Time Task Scheduling & Mobile Time Picker'':
** Tasks can now be scheduled for a specific time of day (e.g., `14:30` / `2:30 pm`) in addition to date-only deadlines, triggering push notifications at that exact timestamp while date-only tasks default to notifying at 12:00 Noon local time
** Added inline time token support (`@today@14:30`, `~tomorrow@09:00`) in task capture inputs
** Redesigned `<$py-time-picker>` for mobile ergonomics with quick-preset chips (`9 AM`, `12 PM`, `3 PM`, `6 PM`) and native touch-friendly Hour / 5-minute step selector wheels
* ''Configurable 12-Hour / 24-Hour Time Formatting'':
** Added `$:/config/projectify/TimeFormat` setting (`auto`, `12h`, `24h`) that defaults to the device's locale clock preference (`Intl.DateTimeFormat`) and formats all task pills, time pickers, and notification messages accordingly

