! Release 0.16.0

!! Modern Task & Project Management Suite

* ''Richer Task Lifecycle'':
** Added multi-stage task statuses: `todo`, `in-progress`, `waiting`, `someday`, `done`, and `cancelled`, with custom SVG icons and quick status switching in the task actions dropdown and task header
** Added separate ''Start / Scheduled'' (`scheduled`) dates alongside ''Due (Deadline)'' (`due`) dates, hiding future-scheduled tasks from //Next Actions// until their start date arrives
** Added ''Recurring tasks'' (`recur`: `daily`, `weekdays`, `weekly`, `monthly`, `yearly`, or `+Nd`/`+Nw`/`+Nm`/`+Ny`) that automatically advance to the next occurrence when checked off
** Recorded `completed` and `last-completed` UTC timestamps when tasks are completed
* ''Project Scaling & Hierarchy'':
** Added ''Inline Sub-Tasks'' (`SubProject`) that expand and collapse directly inside parent task lists with an inline quick-add input
** Upgraded project progress pie charts and open task counts to recursively roll up all nested sub-projects using TiddlyWiki 5.4 `\function` definitions
** Added ''Project Sections'' (`sections` / `section` fields) with drag-and-drop refiling between sections
** Added ''Parallel vs. Sequential'' project modes (`project-mode: parallel | sequential`) and task dependencies (`blocked-by`) with lock badges
* ''Flexible Views & Dashboards'':
** Added per-project ''List vs. Kanban Board'' view switcher (`project-view: list | board`) with drag-and-drop status columns
** Added `@Context` tags (`context` field) with pill badges and context filter bars in the //Next// and //Filter// tabs
** Added ''Eisenhower Matrix'' (`Matrix`) dashboard tab grouping actionable tasks into four urgency/importance quadrants
** Added ''GTD Weekly Review & Completed Logbook'' (`Review`) dashboard tab surfacing //Stalled Projects//, //Waiting & Blocked// tasks, //Someday / Maybe// items, and recently completed tasks
** Added one-click ''Workflow Presets'' (//Minimal / Classic//, //GTD Power//, //Kanban & Agile//, //Full Suite//) in Control Panel > Projectify
* ''Fast Capture & Mobile UX Polish'':
** Added ''Smart Inline Tokens'' (`!1`–`!3`/`p1`–`p3`, `@today`/`@tomorrow`/`@nextweek`/`@YYYY-MM-DD`, `~today`/`~tomorrow`/`~YYYY-MM-DD`, `#Project`/`#[Project Name]`, `@context`) across all task inputs
** Upgraded Quick Capture (`Alt+C`) with target Project, Schedule, and Priority selectors
** Added inline task renaming and a batch ''Reschedule all to Today'' button for overdue tasks
** Redesigned the task actions (`...`) dropdown menu with a compact 2-column grid and collapsible calendar for mobile screens

! Release 0.15.0

!! Fork, TiddlyWiki 5.4+ Modernization & Fixes

* Re-namespaced plugin to `$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify` (maintained by Matt Blackman, forked from Nicolas Petton) with backward-compatible tag fallbacks
* Targeted TiddlyWiki `>=5.4.0`: modernized macros and templates to `\procedure`, `<$let>`, `<%if%>`, and `<$transclude $variable=...>`
* Modernized stylesheets with CSS Grid, Flexbox, and TiddlyWiki 5.4 `--tpc-*` palette custom properties for clean dark/light theme contrast
* Refactored `date-picker.js` to ES6 classes, fixed a bug where `getTiddler()` mutated the wiki during widget render, and improved popup closing and refresh lifecycle
* Fixed upstream bugs: `ui/dashbaord/*` title typos, broken `<<ling TodayAndOverdue>>` macro call, malformed `<$select>` in Dashboard config, unclosed widget tags, wrong `EmptyNextActions` title string, nested `<button>` in `ToggleTodo`, and added blank-input guards on QuickCapture, NewProject, and NewCategory

